## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
AMAT is heavily dependent on foundries (fab-heavy IDM model) and faces capex cycle risks. Its largest customers (TSMC, Samsung) are digesting inventory amid a slowdown in data center demand. While consumer end-market exposure is limited, the dependency on a few key accounts amplifies risk during downcycles.  

**Severity:** **MEDIUM** — Fabs may delay equipment purchases as they manage inventory and capex budgets.  

